<item><title>ACCA Uganda urges accountants to tackle stigma and prepare sustainability data</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/acca-uganda-urges-accountants-to-tackle-stigma-and-prepare-b084c2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/acca-uganda-urges-accountants-to-tackle-stigma-and-prepare-b084c2/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>At its Kampala convention, the association called for earlier environmental data collection as Uganda plans a phased rollout of international reporting standards.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 07:34:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda gives Vitol 10-year mandate to market Pearl Sweet crude</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-gives-vitol-10-year-mandate-to-market-pearl-sweet-c6e48b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-gives-vitol-10-year-mandate-to-market-pearl-sweet-c6e48b/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The international trader will seek buyers and competitive prices, while Uganda National Oil Company retains oversight of each sale.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:10:01 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda suspends mass gatherings in 34 Ebola-risk border districts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-f717b1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-f717b1/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>Concerts, festivals and rallies require written Health Ministry clearance as authorities tighten controls on movement across the border with the DRC.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:00:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-f717b1/share.jpg" length="43663" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-f717b1/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda’s growth plan puts focus on large event venues in Kampala</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-s-growth-plan-puts-focus-on-large-event-venues-in-e9516e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-s-growth-plan-puts-focus-on-large-event-venues-in-e9516e/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The tenfold strategy targets growth from about $50 billion in GDP to $500 billion by 204, with meetings and exhibitions among its pillars.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:11:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda targets 500,000 metric tonnes of cocoa by 2036</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-targets-500-000-metric-tonnes-of-cocoa-by-2036-3df285/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-targets-500-000-metric-tonnes-of-cocoa-by-2036-3df285/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The first national cocoa strategy also seeks to raise local processing from under five per cent to 30% of output.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
